        "position": 3,
        "title": "Pretty good quality that will last",
        "text": "So I think the quality on this is pretty decent. I like how it feels durable. And the metal teeth on this are pretty good and don't bend easily. I would say that this is designed more for a short-haired dog. And in spite if it having a good durable quality, I would say that I do wish that the grip on this had some rubber to it as I feel like I sometimes start to lose a little bit as I feel like it is about to start slipping from my hand. But overall I think that this is a good piece as indeed it help with fleas but at the same time I do feel like it is a bit overpriced for what it is. However, if there's ever any sale, this is going to be absolutely fantastic",
